msgid "Here, warm up in this campfire."
msgstr "여기 모닥불에서 몸 좀 녹이고 가세요."

#. Key:	SgtLakeChestWonder_DialogueText
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_Dialogue.DT_Dialogue.SgtLakeChestWonder.DialogueText_3_A9C5DFDC46C401473F93E1A1C4D4CD4A
