msgid "I wonder how that chest ended up there..."
msgstr "저 상자가 대체 어떻게 저기 올라가있지...?"

#. Key:	SgtLakeFishingSoup_DialogueText
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_Dialogue.DT_Dialogue.SgtLakeFishingSoup.DialogueText_3_A9C5DFDC46C401473F93E1A1C4D4CD4A
