msgid "Lots of fish here. Try cooking a soup!"
msgstr "물고기가 정말 많네요. 생선 수프를 끓여보세요!"

#. Key:	SgtLakeFishingTip_DialogueText
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_Dialogue.DT_Dialogue.SgtLakeFishingTip.DialogueText_3_A9C5DFDC46C401473F93E1A1C4D4CD4A
