msgctxt "DT_Dialogue"
msgid "A fishing rod helps; you can fish and cook to regain energy."
msgstr "낚싯대가 있으면 좋아요, 물고기를 잡아서 요리하면 에너지를 채울 수 있거든요."

#. Key:	4CFD2B8541CD052C7A9DD98E7A84C7AE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_Dialogue.DT_Dialogue.SgtLakeFishingTip2.DialogueText_3_A9C5DFDC46C401473F93E1A1C4D4CD4A
