msgstr "톱 10 상품"

#. Key:	F3BC10374EC9AEF626B51B978FA065A3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Leaderboard/UMG_GlobalLeaderboard.UMG_GlobalLeaderboard_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_5.Text
#: /Game/Widgets/Leaderboard/UMG_GlobalLeaderboard.UMG_GlobalLeaderboard_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_5.Text
msgid "Prize For Position 10 - 200"
msgstr "10위 상품 - 200"

#. Key:	DC8137B345DE2E226E347A810027F1FB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Leaderboard/UMG_GlobalLeaderboard.UMG_GlobalLeaderboard_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_7.Text
#: /Game/Widgets/Leaderboard/UMG_GlobalLeaderboard.UMG_GlobalLeaderboard_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_7.Text
msgid "Join events on any official server by completing tasks listed below. Finish enough tasks to earn Vintercoins, and if you're in the top 10, you'll get a special hat. No event right now? Check back later. Events include fishing, farming, looting, and Arena PVP."
msgstr "아래 나열된 작업을 완료하여 공식 서버의 이벤트에 참여하세요. 충분한 작업을 마치면 Vintercoins을 얻을 수 있고, 상위 10위 안에 들면 특별한 모자를 받습니다. 현재 이벤트가 없나요? 나중에 다시 확인하세요. 이벤트에는 낚시, 농사, 약탈, 아레나 PVP가 포함됩니다."

